WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand with feet shoulder-width, toes slightly out.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Sink into a deep squat.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Elbows press the knees out; hands at heart.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Gently pry side to side.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Stand with control.
